CHAPTER.VERS:
And the king of Israel said to his slaves, Do you

          {+}
         know that Ramoth-gilead is ours, and we are still, and do not take it out of the hand of the king of Syria?

And Micaiah said, If you return at all in peace, Yahweh has not spoken by me. And he said, Hear, you

          {+}
         peoples, all of you

          {+}
        .
